            "text_x9NQ97": {
              "type": "text",
              "name": "t:names.text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Looking for the best cooking wood for your smoker, grill, or backyard fire pit? ButlerWood cuts, prepares, and ships premium cooking wood and firewood straight from Central Texas. The wood you cook with changes how your food turns out, and we give you clean-burning splits that hold steady heat and put real smoke flavor into your brisket, ribs, and chicken.</p><p>Every piece comes from our own <a href=\"https://www.butlerwood.com/pages/land-clearing\" title=\"https://www.butlerwood.com/pages/land-clearing\">land clearing work</a>, so the wood gets recycled and put to good use instead of going to waste. We source it, age it, treat it, and haul it ourselves. That means you get the same consistent splits every time you order, at a price that beats the resellers. Have a question before you buy? Take a look at our <a href=\"https://www.butlerwood.com/pages/f-a-q\" title=\"https://www.butlerwood.com/pages/f-a-q\">F.A.Q. page</a>.</p>",
